#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:5
#: 67810a65a2f14ea6973d484592e308a5
msgid "旧版层错位移（Legacy Stacking Fault）"
msgstr "Legacy Stacking Fault"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:7
#: 874a9b8e0d0d426eaeed646cda84f5eb
msgid "**分类：** 缺陷"
msgstr "**Category:** Defects"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:9
#: 029c7ad64de5465194c3357092b4c1f7
msgid "兼容性说明"
msgstr "Compatibility Notice"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:11
#: 8c57678a38d3435e96a1b8cfea7d43f7
msgid ""
"这张卡保留早期 NepTrainKit 的固定晶胞半区平移算法，用于载入和复现已有工作流。它的“切面一侧整体滑移”思路可以生成层错，也与常见 "
"Atomsk 脚本采用同一种几何操作；问题在于卡片没有让用户显式指定滑移方向，切面参数也容易误解，因此不再出现在“添加新卡片”和“查找卡片”中。"
msgstr ""
"This card preserves the fixed-cell half-region translation algorithm used"
" by early NepTrainKit releases so existing workflows can still be loaded "
"and reproduced. Translating all atoms on one side of a cut can create a "
"stacking fault and is the same geometric operation used by common Atomsk "
"scripts. However, the card never lets the user specify the slip direction"
" explicitly, and its cut-plane parameter is easy to misread, so it is no "
"longer shown in `Add new card` or card search."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:13
#: 1a5feab5c98c482985c91a7baa378b5b
#
msgid ""
"旧 JSON 中的 `StackingFaultCard` 仍可正常载入和运行。新任务请使用 `层错路径`（序列化类名仍为 "
"`StrictGSFEPathCard`）。后者显式要求："
msgstr ""
"Legacy JSON containing `StackingFaultCard` can still be loaded and run. "
"For new work, use `GSFE Path` (whose serialized class name remains "
"`StrictGSFEPathCard`). It explicitly requires:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:15
#: d4298a8b14aa48868c2cbb9ced30e16b
msgid "当前晶胞的 `ab` 层错面；"
msgstr "the current cell's `ab` fault plane;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:16
#: 6e654263f0b8404ab21def7c867f4a83
msgid "当前晶胞基矢下的面内方向；"
msgstr "an in-plane direction expressed in the current cell basis;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:17
#: 2309a78fcd8b4409882ad62ccc291d6a
msgid "位移单位；"
msgstr "the displacement unit;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:18
#: 9ba73cc235d64f6a947992e53e69a287
msgid "切面位置；"
msgstr "the cut position;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:19
#: 5dcde23976d748b19725c159bc4f86f4
msgid "输入晶胞与目标层错面的定向一致性。"
msgstr ""
"whether the input cell is oriented consistently with the intended fault "
"plane."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:21
#: d7bb22b90dc0459d89c382e761bf0d24
msgid "旧版卡没有显式滑移方向，因此仅凭 `近似晶面 h k l`（`hkl`）无法定义一个物理滑移系。"
msgstr ""
"The legacy card has no explicit slip direction, so `Approximate plane h k"
" l` (`hkl`) alone cannot define a physical slip system."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:23
#: 4dc4fcf9771443ed8e3d6214cd4fda3e
msgid "旧算法实际做什么"
msgstr "What the Legacy Algorithm Actually Does"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:25
#: 6363bca4cb7f49bf9650c59646b5c50d
msgid "给定输入晶胞 $A$ 和 `hkl=(h,k,l)`，旧算法先用倒易晶格构造单位法向："
msgstr ""
"Given input cell $A$ and `hkl=(h,k,l)`, the legacy algorithm first "
"constructs a unit normal from the reciprocal lattice:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:27
#: b2bbe211d47d45fe85748f6413b65a3a
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\hat{\\mathbf n}\n"
"=\n"
"\\frac{h\\mathbf b_1+k\\mathbf b_2+l\\mathbf b_3}\n"
"{\\left|h\\mathbf b_1+k\\mathbf b_2+l\\mathbf b_3\\right|}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:34
#: 78c0fad862ed48d4b5ebbd5c0ae998c9
#, python-brace-format
msgid "随后从全局笛卡尔 x、y、z 轴中选择与 $\\hat{\\mathbf n}$ 最不平行的一根轴 $\\mathbf e$，并定义："
msgstr ""
"It then chooses the global Cartesian x, y, or z axis $\\mathbf e$ that is"
" least parallel to $\\hat{\\mathbf n}$ and defines:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:36
#: 4c24c05a71f646089db87982c6ef0182
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\hat{\\mathbf s}\n"
"=\n"
"\\frac{\\hat{\\mathbf n}\\times\\mathbf e}\n"
"{\\left|\\hat{\\mathbf n}\\times\\mathbf e\\right|}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:43
#: 8b05b10cafe44b14b459cb8788c7a571
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"这个 $\\hat{\\mathbf s}$ "
"是确定性的面内方向，但不是用户指定的晶向。只要它恰好等于目标滑移方向，旧算法生成的结构可以是有效层错；否则结果只是另一个方向上的层间错排。把同一物理晶体整体旋转后，所选方向还可能改变。"
msgstr ""
"This $\\hat{\\mathbf s}$ is a deterministic in-plane direction, but it is"
" not a user-selected crystallographic direction. If it happens to equal "
"the intended slip direction, the legacy algorithm can produce a valid "
"stacking fault; otherwise it creates an interlayer offset along another "
"direction. Rotating the same physical crystal can also change the "
"selected direction."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:45
#: 84496ed45fc6410994c75e09a101b28c
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"原子按投影 $q_i=\\mathbf r_i\\cdot\\hat{\\mathbf n}$ "
"排序。`旧版投影层序号`（`layers`）选择第几个投影坐标作为阈值，并移动满足 $q_i\\ge q_\\mathrm{cut}$ 的原子。若"
" `旧版投影层序号`（`layers`）超出投影层数，算法静默改用中间投影层。最后沿 $\\hat{\\mathbf s}$ 施加绝对 Å "
"位移并把坐标折回周期晶胞。"
msgstr ""
"Atoms are sorted by the projection $q_i=\\mathbf r_i\\cdot\\hat{\\mathbf "
"n}$. `Legacy projected-layer index` (`layers`) selects which sorted "
"projection is used as the threshold, and atoms satisfying $q_i\\ge "
"q_\\mathrm{cut}$ are moved. If `layers` exceeds the number of projected "
"layers, the algorithm silently uses the middle layer. It finally applies "
"an absolute displacement in Å along $\\hat{\\mathbf s}$ and wraps "
"coordinates back into the periodic cell."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:47
#: f03f07f4a5564118b0ed36558b214ded
msgid "因此旧卡的核心位移并非错误，但参数面不足以可靠表达任意滑移系："
msgstr ""
"The core translation is therefore not inherently wrong, but the available"
" parameters cannot reliably express an arbitrary slip system:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:49
#: 1a58ec44c903454a8d9691898fef0fca
msgid "默认 `layers=1` 可能选中全部原子，只产生整体平移，没有形成相对层移；"
msgstr ""
"the default `layers=1` may select every atom, producing only a rigid "
"translation rather than relative layer slip;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:50
#: 50f8cfc9845f45bea73f5bb0405a7981
msgid "“层”由投影坐标四舍五入到 8 位后去重，不是带容差的晶体学层识别；"
msgstr ""
"layers are deduplicated after rounding projected coordinates to eight "
"decimal places, rather than identified with a crystallographic tolerance;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:51
#: c8012305b1564317b8b41d4b63ee5abc
msgid "超范围层号不会报错，而会回退到中间层；"
msgstr ""
"an out-of-range layer index falls back to the middle layer instead of "
"reporting an error;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:52
#: daea92ef5a10441fab418649b49c7a4f
msgid "`hkl=(0,0,0)` 会原样返回输入结构；"
msgstr "`hkl=(0,0,0)` returns the input structure unchanged;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:53
#: f62ebde28df94dc2a28535b8b4799779
msgid "输出是否对应目标层错取决于自动方向是否恰好等于目标晶向；"
msgstr ""
"the output matches the intended stacking fault only if the automatically "
"chosen direction happens to equal the target crystallographic direction;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:54
#: 7a4ea5e9cb8f45a893c650d7c3d58f6b
msgid "卡片不检查输入晶胞是否已按目标晶面定向。"
msgstr ""
"the card does not verify that the input cell is oriented for the target "
"fault plane."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:56
#: f9e6e35c88ea4fd0a366fb2854a44fbe
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:58
#: ee6d77fd390442cabc73229d21c412ce
msgid "近似晶面 h k l（hkl）"
msgstr "hkl"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:60
#: 2535abf90c9c49e298b31bc945c012c3
msgid "长度为 3 的整数序列，默认 `(1,1,1)`。只用于构造投影法向，不足以定义物理滑移系。"
msgstr ""
"A length-three integer sequence, default `(1,1,1)`. It is used only to "
"construct the projection normal and is insufficient to define a physical "
"slip system."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:62
#: dbaab2606b484615a97fc8d2c757ee0a
msgid "旧版投影层序号（layers）"
msgstr "layers"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:64
#: 5cd4c38871974f61b55d4fcdb83cbee0
msgid "`int`，默认 1，必须至少为 1。选择排序后的第 `旧版投影层序号`（`layers`）个投影坐标作为移动阈值；并不是“参与层错的层数”。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default 1 and at least 1. Selects the `layers`-th sorted projected"
" coordinate as the movement threshold; it is not the number of layers "
"participating in the fault."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:66
#: 2756006256f5462e8e8e7cd617490ea0
msgid "位移（step）"
msgstr "step"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:68
#: 70dbc4ab625c4a2581c3f01ea7a600ea
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"三个浮点数 `[start, stop, step]`，默认 `[0.0, 1.0, 0.5]`，单位 Å。每个值都是沿旧算法自动选择的 "
"$\\hat{\\mathbf s}$ 的绝对位移。"
msgstr ""
"Three floats `[start, stop, step]`, default `[0.0, 1.0, 0.5]`, in Å. Each"
" value is an absolute displacement along the legacy algorithm's "
"automatically selected $\\hat{\\mathbf s}$."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:70
#: 56dce27a63034db78e1ebd2b0f37cd8f
msgid "兼容配置示例"
msgstr "Legacy Configuration Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:72
#: 99e2fd1ca2214f4aa94ac5ced05fd594
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"StackingFaultCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"hkl\": [1, 1, 1],\n"
"    \"step\": [0.0, 1.0, 0.5],\n"
"    \"layers\": 2\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:84
#: 7bf68d2e57fd436e84bfabd8dc5704b3
msgid "该示例仅用于重现旧工作流。新任务应使用显式卡片，把晶面、滑移方向和切面分别写清楚。"
msgstr ""
"This example is only for reproducing a legacy workflow. For new work, use"
" an explicit card that records the plane, slip direction, and cut "
"separately."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:86
#: 5b88e65fce754ea4b8454e635e0388f7
msgid "如何迁移到显式 GSFE"
msgstr "Migrating to Explicit GSFE"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:88
#: 61b3ba9d43524940a5a92b247d0bbdc1
msgid "旧配置不能自动无损转换，因为其中没有记录滑移方向。迁移时需要根据材料和目标滑移系人工确定 `slip_uvw`，并重新检查切面。"
msgstr ""
"A legacy configuration cannot be converted losslessly because it does not"
" record the slip direction. During migration, determine `slip_uvw` "
"manually from the material and target slip system, then recheck the cut "
"plane."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:90
#: 8c2ca7f36641495fb3f84043642f959f
msgid "示意配置："
msgstr "Illustrative configuration:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:92
#: 783b8b93f3734736b777b768d4a72dc9
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"StrictGSFEPathCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"plane_hkl\": [0, 0, 1],\n"
"    \"slip_uvw\": [1, 0, 0],\n"
"    \"displacement_range\": [0.0, 1.0, 0.1],\n"
"    \"displacement_unit\": \"fraction_of_vector\",\n"
"    \"cut_mode\": \"middle\",\n"
"    \"cut_fraction\": 0.5,\n"
"    \"layer_index\": 0,\n"
"    \"wrap\": true\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:109
#: d570398a4db9450aac9a13438804c19c
msgid "这里的指数只是格式示例，不能直接照搬到具体材料。"
msgstr ""
"These indices illustrate the format only and must not be copied directly "
"to a specific material."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:111
#: 66b36806acbd46ceafa1311cf05bfff4
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:113
#: fcbd1329633a4a2491db84d317d1d3f7
#, python-brace-format
msgid "SF(hkl={h}{k}{l},d={displacement})\n"
msgstr "SF(hkl={h}{k}{l},d={displacement})\n"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:117
#: 3091b41437ba4ec0970964890429242d
msgid "标签表示旧算法参数，不证明输出是物理有效的层错或孪晶。"
msgstr ""
"The label records legacy algorithm parameters; it does not prove that the"
" output is a physically valid stacking fault or twin."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:119
#: 51e8d852612148efac61cddbfe378ad5
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:121
#: a3717033347b4d63a06ca6bf855491b4
msgid "无随机性。同一坐标系中的同一输入和参数会得到一致输出；把结构旋转到另一笛卡尔取向后，结果不保证等价。"
msgstr ""
"There is no randomness. The same input and parameters in the same "
"coordinate frame produce the same output; rotating the structure to a "
"different Cartesian orientation is not guaranteed to give an equivalent "
"result."

